{
  "id": 3495,
  "title": "强化学习中的神经网络架构",
  "meta_title": "强化学习中的神经网络架构 | 强化学习进阶",
  "meta_description": "用于策略和值函数设计的网络架构（CNN、RNN、Transformer）的最佳实践。",
  "content": "<p>在实现深度强化学习 (reinforcement learning)智能体时，选择合适的神经网络 (neural network)架构非常重要。就像建筑物的地基决定了它的稳定性和高度一样，网络结构极大地影响着智能体的学习能力、训练过程中的稳定性以及整体表现。核心强化学习算法决定了智能体<em>如何</em>学习，而网络架构则决定了它<em>能表示什么</em>以及<em>如何高效地</em>处理来自环境的信息。</p>\n<p>本节主要讨论设计这些网络时的实际考量，会根据强化学习任务的具体要求进行调整，并建立在您已有的深度学习 (deep learning)组件知识之上。</p>\n<h3>处理环境观测</h3>\n<p>设计网络的第一步是处理输入：环境提供的观测值（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。观测空间的性质在很大程度上决定了网络的初始层。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>向量 (vector)观测：</strong> 对于状态表示为固定大小数值特征向量（例如，倒立摆位置和速度、机器人关节角度）的环境，标准多层感知机（MLP）通常很有效。这些通常由若干个带有ReLU等非线性激活函数 (activation function)的全连接（密集）层组成。对于MLP输入，对输入特征进行缩放（归一化 (normalization)或标准化）对于稳定训练通常非常重要。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>图像观测：</strong> 当智能体通过图像（例如，Atari游戏屏幕的像素，或机器人中的摄像头反馈）感知环境时，卷积神经网络 (neural network)（CNN）是标准选择。受计算机视觉成功经验的启发，常见的模式是堆叠多个卷积层（通常带有ReLU激活和可能的池化层）以提取特征的空间层次结构，之后是一个或多个全连接层，以产生最终输出（Q值或策略参数 (parameter)）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预处理：</strong> 原始像素很少直接使用。常见的预处理步骤包括将图像转换为灰度、下采样，以及堆叠连续帧（例如4帧），以向网络提供关于运动和动态的信息。</li>\n<li><strong>示例结构：</strong> <code>Input (stacked frames) -> Conv2D -> ReLU -> Conv2D -> ReLU -> Conv2D -> ReLU -> Flatten -> Dense -> ReLU -> Output Layer</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>序列观测：</strong> 如果观测具有固有时间依赖性，且无法通过简单的帧堆叠完全捕捉，或者输入本身是序列化的（例如，基于文本游戏中的文本、时间序列数据），则可以使用循环神经网络（RNN），如长短期记忆（LSTM）或门控循环单元（GRU）。这些网络维护内部隐藏状态，允许它们随时间整合信息。使用RNN会增加训练的复杂性，需要时间反向传播 (backpropagation)（BPTT）等技术，并谨慎处理隐藏状态，尤其是在使用经验回放时。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Transformer架构：</strong> 对于涉及非常长距离依赖关系或结构化数据（如自然语言指令或复杂关系环境）的任务，使用自注意力 (self-attention)机制 (attention mechanism)的Transformer网络变得越来越可行。它们擅长建模序列中远距离点之间的依赖关系，但与CNN或RNN相比，计算成本和数据需求更高。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>生成智能体动作</h3>\n<p>网络的输出层必须与环境的动作空间（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）相匹配。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>离散动作空间：</strong> 对于具有有限动作集（例如，“左”、“右”、“开火”）的环境，网络通常输出一个向量 (vector)，其中每个元素对应一个动作。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基于值的方法（例如，DQN）：</strong> 输出层为状态<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span>中的每个可能动作<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span>提供估计的Q值 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(s, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。线性输出层很常见。</li>\n<li><strong>基于策略的方法（例如，A2C、PPO）：</strong> 输出层为每个动作提供logits（未归一化 (normalization)的对数概率）。这些logits通常通过Softmax函数形成一个分类概率分布 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(a|s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，从中抽取动作。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>连续动作空间：</strong> 对于动作是连续向量（例如，电机扭矩、转向角度）的环境，网络输出定义动作概率分布的参数 (parameter)。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确定性策略（例如，DDPG）：</strong> 网络直接输出动作向量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = \\mu(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。通常将<code>tanh</code>等激活函数 (activation function)应用于输出层，以将动作限制在特定范围（例如[-1, 1]）内，然后可以根据环境要求进行缩放。</li>\n<li><strong>随机策略（例如，PPO、SAC）：</strong> 网络通常输出某个分布的参数，最常见的是高斯分布的均值 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 和标准差 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>（或为稳定性考虑使用对数标准差）。动作然后从 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{N}(\\mu(s), \\sigma(s)^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 中采样。必须注意确保标准差保持正值（例如，通过使用<code>softplus</code>激活函数或对网络输出进行指数运算）。在这些Actor-Critic设置中，评论家网络仍然输出一个标量值估计（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>或<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(s, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Actor-Critic 方法的常见网络结构</h3>\n<p>在Actor-Critic算法中，你需要分别用于策略（actor）和值函数（critic）的网络。一个常见的设计选择是它们之间是否共享参数 (parameter)。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>独立网络：</strong> 为actor和critic使用完全独立的网络。这更易于实现和调试，并避免了策略和值函数学习目标之间潜在的负面干扰。然而，它可能样本效率较低，因为与两个任务相关的特征是单独学习的。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>共享主干，分离头部：</strong> 使用共同的初始层（例如，用于图像处理的CNN层）从观测中提取共享特征表示。然后，为actor（策略输出）和critic（值输出）附加独立的输出层（“头部”）。这鼓励学习共享表示，可能提高样本效率和泛化能力。然而，平衡共享部分和独立部分的梯度和学习率可能具有挑战性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-qks5jz\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph SharedVsSeparate {\n    rankdir=LR;\n    node [shape=box, style=rounded, fontname=\"sans-serif\", margin=0.2];\n    edge [fontname=\"sans-serif\"];\n\n    subgraph cluster_separate {\n        label = \"独立网络\";\n        bgcolor=\"#e9ecef\";\n        obs_sep [label=\"观测\"];\n        actor_base_sep [label=\"Actor基础层\"];\n        critic_base_sep [label=\"Critic基础层\"];\n        actor_head_sep [label=\"策略输出\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n        critic_head_sep [label=\"值输出\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffd8a8\"];\n\n        obs_sep -> actor_base_sep [label=\" \"];\n        obs_sep -> critic_base_sep [label=\" \"];\n        actor_base_sep -> actor_head_sep;\n        critic_base_sep -> critic_head_sep;\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_shared {\n        label = \"共享主干\";\n        bgcolor=\"#e9ecef\";\n        obs_shared [label=\"观测\"];\n        shared_base [label=\"共享基础层 (例如, CNN)\"];\n        actor_head_shared [label=\"策略输出\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n        critic_head_shared [label=\"值输出\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffd8a8\"];\n\n        obs_shared -> shared_base;\n        shared_base -> actor_head_shared;\n        shared_base -> critic_head_shared;\n    }\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-qks5jz\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>Actor-Critic方法中独立网络与共享主干架构的比较。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Dueling架构（基于值）</h3>\n<p>如第二章所述，Dueling网络架构是一种专门的修改，主要用于DQN等基于值的方法。它在特征提取层之后将网络分成两个流：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>值流：</strong> 估计状态值函数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。输出一个标量。</li>\n<li><strong>优势流：</strong> 估计每个动作的优势函数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(s, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。输出一个维度等于动作数量的向量 (vector)。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这些流随后组合起来以生成最终的Q值。一个常见的聚合方法是：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(s, a) = V(s) + \\left( A(s, a) - \\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{A}|} \\sum_{a'} A(s, a') \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.044em;vertical-align:-1.294em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.856em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.294em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>这种中心化操作确保了可识别性并提高了稳定性。直观理解是，将状态的内在价值与动作特异性优势分开，可以带来更有效的学习，尤其是在某个状态的价值不强烈依赖于所采取的具体动作时。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-1trojfd\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph DuelingDQN {\n    rankdir=LR;\n    node [shape=box, style=rounded, fontname=\"sans-serif\", margin=0.2];\n    edge [fontname=\"sans-serif\"];\n\n    obs [label=\"观测\"];\n    base_cnn [label=\"基础层 (例如, CNN)\"];\n    value_stream [label=\"值流\\n(密集层)\"];\n    advantage_stream [label=\"优势流\\n(密集层)\"];\n    value_output [label=\"V(s) (标量)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\"];\n    advantage_output [label=\"A(s,a) (向量)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#bac8ff\"];\n    aggregation [label=\"聚合\\n(组合V和A)\"];\n    q_output [label=\"Q(s,a) (向量)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffec99\"];\n\n    obs -> base_cnn;\n    base_cnn -> value_stream [label=\" \"];\n    base_cnn -> advantage_stream [label=\" \"];\n    value_stream -> value_output;\n    advantage_stream -> advantage_output;\n    value_output -> aggregation;\n    advantage_output -> aggregation;\n    aggregation -> q_output;\n\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-1trojfd\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>Dueling网络架构的结构，它在组合为Q值之前分离了值和优势的估计。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>架构设计原则与技巧</h3>\n<p>虽然没有适用于所有强化学习 (reinforcement learning)问题的“最佳”架构，但以下一些指导原则有所帮助：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>从简单开始：</strong> 从已知的、相对较浅的、适用于类似问题的架构（例如，DQN的标准Atari CNN）开始。仅当性能停滞不前，并且你怀疑表示能力是瓶颈时，才增加复杂性（深度、宽度、循环性）。</li>\n<li><strong>输入/输出匹配：</strong> 确保输入层与观测空间匹配，输出层与动作空间和算法要求（Q值、策略分布参数 (parameter)）匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>归一化 (normalization)：</strong> 输入观测的归一化通常很重要。可以应用诸如滑动平均/标准差滤波器或批归一化等技术，但在强化学习中，由于策略演变和经验回放缓冲区可能导致数据分布非平稳，使用层归一化或谨慎使用批归一化。奖励缩放或裁剪也是常见做法。</li>\n<li><strong>激活函数 (activation function)：</strong> ReLU因其简单性和在缓解梯度消失方面的有效性，仍然是隐藏层的常见选择。<code>tanh</code>常用于限制连续动作的范围。选择适合所需特定输出的激活函数（例如，Q值的线性函数，标准差的<code>softplus</code>函数）。</li>\n<li><strong>初始化：</strong> 标准的权重 (weight)初始化技术（例如，正交初始化、Xavier、He）是重要的起点。有时，将最终策略层初始化为非常小的权重有助于鼓励初始的探索。</li>\n<li><strong>参考文献：</strong> 参考现有研究。论文通常会详细说明用于基准任务的架构。从一个已被验证的架构开始可以显著增加成功实现的几率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选择和优化网络架构是一个迭代过程，通常需要结合超参数 (hyperparameter)调整（下一节介绍）进行实验，以实现给定强化学习任务的最佳性能。</p>",
